      "title": "Farage accused of ‘protecting’ Reform candidate over racist slurs against David Lammy",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/15/farage-accused-protecting-reform-candidate-racist-slurs-david-lammy-itv-film",
      "description": "<p>Exclusive: ITV investigation shows leader stood by mayoral candidate who said Labour MP should ‘go home to the Caribbean’</p><p>Nigel Farage was told by a senior Reform official that he was “protecting” a high-profile mayoral candidate accused of making racist comments about David Lammy, an undercover investigation has revealed.</p><p>The latest footage from an undercover investigation by ITV also shows Sarah Pochin, one of two female MPs for Reform, complaining that other party officials “are so fucking chauvinistic” and that “they just exclude you if you are a woman”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/15/farage-accused-protecting-reform-candidate-racist-slurs-david-lammy-itv-film\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
